{
 "total": 151.045,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "scene": "hook",
   "text": "Applying for jobs is a full-time job.",
   "file": "voice/hook1.wav",
   "dur": 2.9,
   "start": 0.45,
   "end": 3.35
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "scene": "hook",
   "text": "Except it doesn't pay, and it's ninety percent dropdowns.",
   "file": "voice/hook2.wav",
   "dur": 3.825,
   "start": 3.67,
   "end": 7.495
  },
  {
   "id": "meet1",
   "scene": "meet",
   "text": "Meet Job Hunter Agent.",
   "file": "voice/meet1.wav",
   "dur": 2.125,
   "start": 8.245,
   "end": 10.37
  },
  {
   "id": "meet2",
   "scene": "meet",
   "text": "It does the boring part. You stay in charge of the part that matters.",
   "file": "voice/meet2.wav",
   "dur": 4.25,
   "start": 10.69,
   "end": 14.94
  },
  {
   "id": "s1a",
   "scene": "standing",
   "text": "Step one: answer the questions every application asks. Once.",
   "file": "voice/s1a.wav",
   "dur": 4.5,
   "start": 15.69,
   "end": 20.19
  },
  {
   "id": "s1b",
   "scene": "standing",
   "text": "Your name, your visa, whether you'd move to New York. Prefer not to say is always an option.",
   "file": "voice/s1b.wav",
   "dur": 5.975,
   "start": 20.51,
   "end": 26.485
  },
  {
   "id": "s2a",
   "scene": "storybook",
   "text": "Step two: tell it your story.",
   "file": "voice/s2a.wav",
   "dur": 2.3,
   "start": 27.235,
   "end": 29.535
  },
  {
   "id": "s2b",
   "scene": "storybook",
   "text": "Type it, say it out loud, or just drop in a résumé you secretly admire.",
   "file": "voice/s2b.wav",
   "dur": 4.925,
   "start": 29.855,
   "end": 34.78
  },
  {
   "id": "s2d",
   "scene": "storybook",
   "text": "Say what you like about it, hit Send, and watch it rewrite your storybook in that style, line by line.",
   "file": "voice/s2d.wav",
   "dur": 6.3,
   "start": 35.1,
   "end": 41.4
  },
  {
   "id": "s2c",
   "scene": "storybook",
   "text": "This storybook is the only thing the agent is allowed to say about you. So, no surprise PhD.",
   "file": "voice/s2c.wav",
   "dur": 6.525,
   "start": 41.72,
   "end": 48.245
  },
  {
   "id": "s2e",
   "scene": "storybook",
   "text": "Don't love it? One click takes you back.",
   "file": "voice/s2e.wav",
   "dur": 2.75,
   "start": 48.865,
   "end": 51.615
  },
  {
   "id": "s3a",
   "scene": "find",
   "text": "Every morning, it checks the job boards of the companies you care about.",
   "file": "voice/s3a.wav",
   "dur": 4.45,
   "start": 52.365,
   "end": 56.815
  },
  {
   "id": "s3b",
   "scene": "find",
   "text": "Then it scores every role. Green means go, orange means maybe, and under fifty, it doesn't even bother.",
   "file": "voice/s3b.wav",
   "dur": 6.6,
   "start": 57.135,
   "end": 63.735
  },
  {
   "id": "s4a",
   "scene": "prepare",
   "text": "Hit Prepare, and it builds a one-page résumé from your storybook.",
   "file": "voice/s4a.wav",
   "dur": 4.4,
   "start": 64.485,
   "end": 68.885
  },
  {
   "id": "s4b",
   "scene": "fill",
   "text": "Then it fills out the actual application. Names, dropdowns, even those tiny checkboxes nobody reads.",
   "file": "voice/s4b.wav",
   "dur": 7.3,
   "start": 71.235,
   "end": 78.535
  },
  {
   "id": "s4c",
   "scene": "fill",
   "text": "And when a form asks why you want to work there, it starts with their mission, not a cover-letter cliché.",
   "file": "voice/s4c.wav",
   "dur": 6.475,
   "start": 78.855,
   "end": 85.33
  },
  {
   "id": "s5a",
   "scene": "review",
   "text": "And then, it stops.",
   "file": "voice/s5a.wav",
   "dur": 1.8,
   "start": 86.08,
   "end": 87.88
  },
  {
   "id": "s5b",
   "scene": "review",
   "text": "Everything waits for you in the review queue.",
   "file": "voice/s5b.wav",
   "dur": 2.9,
   "start": 88.2,
   "end": 91.1
  },
  {
   "id": "s5c",
   "scene": "review",
   "text": "Anything only you can answer shows up right here, with the form's own options.",
   "file": "voice/s5c.wav",
   "dur": 4.925,
   "start": 91.42,
   "end": 96.345
  },
  {
   "id": "s5d",
   "scene": "review",
   "text": "Nothing goes out until you hit Approve. You're the boss. The agent is the intern who actually read the job description.",
   "file": "voice/s5d.wav",
   "dur": 7.575,
   "start": 96.665,
   "end": 104.24
  },
  {
   "id": "s5e",
   "scene": "human",
   "text": "If a CAPTCHA or an email code shows up, that one's yours. It's a robot, and it's not allowed to pretend otherwise.",
   "file": "voice/s5e.wav",
   "dur": 7.475,
   "start": 105.29,
   "end": 112.765
  },
  {
   "id": "s6a",
   "scene": "track",
   "text": "After you apply, it reads your inbox, read-only, and moves each application along.",
   "file": "voice/s6a.wav",
   "dur": 5.6,
   "start": 113.515,
   "end": 119.115
  },
  {
   "id": "s6b",
   "scene": "track",
   "text": "Received, next step, interview, offer. Or, you know, the other one.",
   "file": "voice/s6b.wav",
   "dur": 4.225,
   "start": 119.435,
   "end": 123.66
  },
  {
   "id": "arch1",
   "scene": "arch",
   "text": "Under the hood, it's a simple pipeline.",
   "file": "voice/arch1.wav",
   "dur": 2.725,
   "start": 124.41,
   "end": 127.135
  },
  {
   "id": "arch2",
   "scene": "arch",
   "text": "Your storybook goes in. The agent finds roles, ranks them, builds the résumé, and fills the form.",
   "file": "voice/arch2.wav",
   "dur": 6.825,
   "start": 127.455,
   "end": 134.28
  },
  {
   "id": "arch3",
   "scene": "arch",
   "text": "You approve. It submits, tracks the replies, and learns from your notes, one small fix at a time, which you approve too.",
   "file": "voice/arch3.wav",
   "dur": 7.525,
   "start": 134.6,
   "end": 142.125
  },
  {
   "id": "end1",
   "scene": "end",
   "text": "Job Hunter Agent. Open source, and on your side.",
   "file": "voice/end1.wav",
   "dur": 3.625,
   "start": 142.875,
   "end": 146.5
  },
  {
   "id": "end2",
   "scene": "end",
   "text": "It does the grind. You do the talking.",
   "file": "voice/end2.wav",
   "dur": 2.625,
   "start": 146.82,
   "end": 149.445
  }
 ],
